{"coverage":588,"partial":true,"day_closed":false,"window":"00:00–15:12","movers":[{"symbol":"WHEELS","ticker":"WHEELS","company":"Wheels India Limited","event_type":"fund_raise","quantum":"Rs 250.00 cr, 11,97,318 shares at Rs 2,088; ~4.5% of mcap","headline":"**completes its qualified institutions placement**, allotting shares at a 4.97% discount to the floor price to institutions including Aditya Birla Sun Life, SBI and WhiteOak funds","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/B7BD3384-D99B-47BE-BB32-1E0B18B1CDA8-091734.pdf","mcap":5610.8,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/B7BD3384-D99B-47BE-BB32-1E0B18B1CDA8-091734.pdf"},{"symbol":"HIGHNESS","ticker":"HIGHNESS","company":"Highness Microelectronics Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"approx Rs 6.00 cr incl. taxes and freight; ~4.9% of mcap","headline":"receives a **purchase order from Premia Solutionz for medical displays, equipment accessories and backlight units**, to be executed in 16 to 20 weeks","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/e1f9e386-fc1a-455c-a542-f627ff477a6d.pdf","mcap":122.6,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/e1f9e386-fc1a-455c-a542-f627ff477a6d.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Highness Microelectronics** - receives a **purchase order of about Rs 6 crore including taxes and freight from Premia Solutionz for medical displays, equipment accessories and backlight units**, deliverable in 16 to 20 weeks _(~4.9% of mcap)_.","**Silver Touch Technologies** - wins a **purchase order from ISRO's Space Applications Centre, Ahmedabad, to supply and support GPU-class high-end workstations**, delivery by 2 February 2027 under a tender reserved for local suppliers; value not disclosed."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Wheels India** - **allots 11,97,318 shares at Rs 2,088 in its qualified institutions placement, raising Rs 250 crore** at a 4.97% discount to the floor price, with Aditya Birla Sun Life, SBI and WhiteOak funds among the allottees _(~4.5% of mcap)_.","**Rashtriya Chemicals and Fertilizers** - shareholders at the AGM **approve a further public offer of fresh equity of up to Rs 1,500 crore**, subject to the Department of Fertilizers and DIPAM, and amend the main objects clause - an enabling approval.","**Seshachal Technologies** - calls a **19 October EGM to approve a preferential issue of 55,000 shares at Rs 76, Rs 41.80 lakh, to two promoters**, Ch. Narendra and Ch. Anitha."],"equity_allotments":["**Sharika Enterprises** - **allots 1,21,92,125 shares at Rs 14.33, Rs 17.47 crore, to non-promoters and 28,12,315 warrants at the same price to promoter and non-promoter investors, collecting 25% upfront** - a new preferential issue _(~20.3% of mcap)_."],"m_and_a":["**IndiGrid Infrastructure Trust** - **signs agreements to buy Luhri Power Transmission from Enerica ReGrid once the project is complete and earning, at an enterprise value up to INR 13,360 million**, a related-party deal needing unitholder approval.","**Adani Enterprises** - wholly-owned Adani Global **buys 50% of Abu Dhabi-registered Monvarex Aluminium Holding for USD 25,000**, a nil-turnover vehicle to pursue alumina, aluminium smelting and coal-to-gas business in India.","**RPG Life Sciences** - subsidiary **RPG Active Pharma's board approves absorbing its wholly-owned Actis Generics**, which had FY26 revenue of Rs 45.96 crore; no shares will be issued, subject to NCLT and shareholder approval.","**H.G. Infra Engineering** - **acquires 100% of Ranipur Chunar Power Transmission from REC Power Development for Rs 5 lakh**, the SPV to build 220/132/33 kV substations at Mau and Mirzapur in Uttar Pradesh under a 35-year transmission project.","**Transcorp International** - says its **2022 scheme of arrangement is not being progressed in its existing form** after its principal regulator conveyed its position; the board will reconsider it."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 13 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Zydus Lifesciences** - a **USFDA inspection of its pharmacovigilance and post-marketing surveillance system at its New Jersey office, 22 to 25 September, closes with nil observations**.","**Augmont Enterprises** - **NSE empanels it as a key partner to promote Electronic Gold Receipts**, supporting conversion of physical gold into exchange-traded EGRs and back.","**TVS Motor Company** - **launches the NTORQ 150 hyper-sport scooter in Nepal** through Jagdamba Motors, at an introductory price the release gives as Rupees 3,69,900.","**Swelect Energy Systems** - **rolls out its BIS-certified SWEES EN+ solar hybrid inverter range of 5 kW to 50 kW for commercial and industrial customers**, on schedule for Q2 FY27.","**Ksolves India** - the chairman tells the 12th AGM that **over 80% of active projects now include AI and all staff are certified on Claude**, and that it is working towards a formal partnership."],"distress_risk":["**Cochin Minerals and Rutile** - the **Kerala High Court stays proceedings on a GST show cause notice involving Rs 120.26 crore of tax** over product classification for FY21 to FY24; it expects no impact at present.","**Godavari Biorefineries** - receives a **HESCOM demand notice for Rs 12.88 crore of cross-subsidy charges on open-access power drawn in 2013-2016**, Rs 5.91 crore principal and Rs 6.97 crore interest; it books the principal as contingent.","**Oracle Financial Services Software** - receives **income-tax penalty orders of Rs 6.10 crore for AY 2009-10 and Rs 3.20 crore for AY 2011-12** for alleged inaccurate particulars; it will appeal and expects no impact.","**Teerth Gopicon** - its interim resolution professional **convenes the second committee-of-creditors meeting for 29 September**, after creditors with 78.86% of votes rejected confirming him as resolution professional.","**Vivimed Labs** - its **committee of creditors approves seeking a three-month extension from the Registrar of Companies to hold the FY26 AGM**.","**Kalahridhaan Trendz Limited** — Kalahridhaan Trendz Limited has informed the Exchange about Corporate Insolvency Resolution Process"],"open_offers":["**Tusaldah Ltd** — Sandeep Jagdishprasad Agrawal open offer for 26.0% (37.83 lakh shares) at Rs 20 vs CMP 143.35 (-86.0%); >25% acquisition (Reg 3(1)) + creeping (Reg 3(2)); **DO NOT TENDER - market pays more than the offer**; tender window not in PA (comes with DPS/LoF); mcap Rs 34 cr"],"credit_rating_changes":["**Wonder Electricals** - **CARE assigns CARE BBB/Stable and CARE A3+ ratings on Rs 72.20 crore of bank facilities**, a first rating from the agency."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","open_offers":"Open offers (PA)","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"Highness Microelectronics Ltd","ticker":"HIGHNESS","company":"Highness Microelectronics Ltd","isin":"","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/e1f9e386-fc1a-455c-a542-f627ff477a6d.pdf","mcap":122.6},{"mcap":null}],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":[{"label":"WHEELS","ticker":"WHEELS","company":"Wheels India Ltd","isin":"INE715A01015","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/B7BD3384-D99B-47BE-BB32-1E0B18B1CDA8-091734.pdf","mcap":5610.8},{"label":"RCF","ticker":"RCF","company":"Rashtriya Chemicals and Fertilizers Ltd","isin":"INE027A01015","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/a9b9aee5-